sequenceDiagram
    participant CU as Customer App
    participant CB as Company Backend
    participant API as VGDP Validator API
    participant DR as DisputeResolver
    participant VER as LocationVerifier
    participant REG as DeliveryProofRegistry
    participant REP as Reputation
    participant IDX as Event Indexer

    CU->>CB: tap "Order not received"
    CB->>API: POST /disputes/resolve (orderId, proofId, expectedLatE7, expectedLonE7, radiusMeters, solidityProof)

    API->>API: companyFromApiKey — authenticate company
    API->>API: look up order and proofId in DB

    API->>DR: resolveDispute(proofId, expectedLatE7, expectedLonE7, radiusMeters, proof)

    DR->>REG: getProof(proofId)
    REG-->>DR: ProofRecord {zkProofHash, orderIdHash, riderDidHash, ...}

    DR->>DR: actualProofHash = keccak256(abi.encode(proof.a, proof.b, proof.c))
    DR->>DR: proofHashMatches = (actualProofHash == record.zkProofHash)
    DR->>DR: publicSignals = _publicSignals(orderIdHash, riderDidHash, timestampHash, latE7, lonE7, radius)

    DR->>VER: verifyProof(proof.a, proof.b, proof.c, publicSignals)
    VER-->>DR: true / false (Groth16 pairing check)

    alt proof valid (hash matches AND verifier returns true)
        DR->>REP: updateAfterDispute(riderDidHash, riderVindicated=true)
        DR->>REG: markResolved(proofId)
        DR-->>API: Outcome.RiderVindicated (1)
        DR->>DR: emit DisputeResolved(..., outcome=RiderVindicated)
    else proof invalid
        DR->>REP: updateAfterDispute(riderDidHash, riderVindicated=false)
        DR->>REG: markResolved(proofId)
        DR-->>API: Outcome.CustomerRefund (2)
        DR->>DR: emit DisputeResolved(..., outcome=CustomerRefund)
    end

    DR-->>IDX: DisputeResolved event
    IDX->>CB: HMAC-signed webhook {type: "delivery.dispute_resolved", outcome, transactionHash}

    API-->>CB: 200 {proofId, outcome, transactionHash, resolvedAtEpoch}

    alt outcome = rider_vindicated
        CB-->>CU: show "Delivery verified — escalate to manual review?"
    else outcome = customer_refund
        CB-->>CU: show "Refund approved automatically"
    end
